# Generated dataset.  11 MB, and deterministic given --seed, so it is cheaper
# to regenerate than to version:  python scripts/make_dataset.py  (~30 s).
# The provenance file is small and IS tracked, so the ranges and limitations
# behind a given CSV stay in history even though the rows do not.
